Hello all,

I am a researcher and currently working on MPTCP.

I am able to use the in Kernel PM, and trying to define different rules to
the subflows. The Userspace PM has been configured, but the data still
flows only through one interface using sspi PM. Screenshots of the -d logs
from client and server have been attached.

Can you please help me with a sample PM plugin file like sspi or addr_adv
that uses both (more than one) interfaces to send the data? or
sspi_connection_established implementation that can send the data through
all the interfaces?

Thank you in advance.

Thanks and Regards,
*Roshith Sebastian,*

